
固件启动管理器
---------------------
标识符                  {fwbootmgr}
displayorder            {bootmgr}
                        {999c02c6-bda7-11f1-8b02-c36529558fff}
timeout                 1

Windows 启动管理器
--------------------
标识符                  {bootmgr}
device                  partition=\Device\HarddiskVolume1
path                    \EFI\Microsoft\Boot\bootmgfw.efi
description             Windows Boot Manager
locale                  zh-CN
inherit                 {globalsettings}
default                 {current}
resumeobject            {999c02c7-bda7-11f1-8b02-c36529558fff}
displayorder            {current}
toolsdisplayorder       {memdiag}
timeout                 30

固件应用程序(101fffff)
-------------------------------
标识符                  {999c02c6-bda7-11f1-8b02-c36529558fff}
device                  partition=\Device\HarddiskVolume1
path                    \EFI\fedora\shimx64.efi
description             Fedora
